# Registering an event
    def handle_dialog(dialog):
        dialog.accept()
    page.on("dialog", handle_dialog)

            (OR)

# Registering an event
    page.on("dialog", lambda dialog:dialog.accept())    #lambda parameters: expression


Conformation-Alert/Dialog box:
------------------------------
